<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Ambush Skill</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Ranger (guild level 18)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> ambush &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Hiding in the shadows waiting for your arch nemesis, an ambush is
a surprise attack that lets you take them by surprise and deal the first
damage, if you do not miss that is.
</p><p>You must be hiding (see <a cmd='#'>Help Hide</a>) and wielding a weapon, and you can't
ambush while you are fighting. You leap out and strike one blow with your
weapon, and the fight is on. The higher your level, the easier the blow is
to land; a victim who can detect life sees you coming, and it is harder
instead. Each try costs 20 endurance, so you need at least 20 to try. You
can ambush another player only when both of you have signed the Book of
Blood.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre> &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help hide</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Ranger Skills</a>
</pre>




</div>